# Snap out BOTH springblades and let the sidebar say what two-weapon fighting
# with them costs.
#
# bd inc-tek.8.8, finding PA-08-F14. Item "springblade" carried
# `Group: WG_SBLADES`. The short sword it is otherwise a copy of carries
# `Group: WG_SBLADES | WG_LIGHT` (lib/weapons.irh:401), and every other stat on
# the springblade is the same or better, so the missing tag is an oversight.
#
# WHAT THE TAG CHANGES. Creature::CalcValues charges an extra -2 to the main
# hand and -2 to the off hand when the off-hand weapon is neither light nor
# smaller than the main-hand weapon (src/Values.cpp:1345-1352). Two springblades
# are the same size as each other, so without WG_LIGHT that clause fires.
#
# THE ORACLE is the sidebar's own "Hit:" line, which prints the main hand and
# the off hand either side of a slash. It is the engine's arithmetic, printed
# by the game, and tools/check_springblade.sh reads it back off the dump.
#
# THE CHARACTER CARRIES TWO-WEAPON STYLE because the bracers deploy a second
# blade only for a wielder who has it, and the clause under test reads the OFF
# hand. See chargen-rogue-twf.keys. That feat also silences a different -2/-2
# clause four lines above the one being measured (src/Values.cpp:1326-1329),
# which is convenient rather than necessary: it leaves fewer moving parts
# between the tag and the number on screen.
#
# SIX ACTIVATION ATTEMPTS, because a rogue fails the DC 15 Handle Device check
# more often than not and a jammed attempt costs a round and nothing else. The
# check requires that a dump said BOTH blades snapped out -- the plural line --
# before it believes the Hit numbers, since one blade would leave the off hand
# empty and the clause unexercised.

@include chargen-rogue-twf.keys
@include springblade-gear.keys

@dump:0001-before-deploy

a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0002-deploy-1
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0003-deploy-2
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0004-deploy-3
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0005-deploy-4
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0006-deploy-5
a
@choose "Springblade Bracers"
@dump:0007-deploy-6

@quit
